{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15210330","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210330","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032001:":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog45>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCAB2BD21B2EA823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032002:":{"text":"Did I really do that badly?","source_cn":"我真的做得很糟糕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F3F0506C7CD625D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032003:":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog104>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7BE6E6A945A0962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521032004:":{"text":"Is all this... Halia's suffering, because of me?","source_cn":"呼临城的灾难是因为我吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91EA26CE34D3012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034001:":{"text":"Please! make way!","source_cn":"呼、呼！麻烦让一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD458CEF998BB9A87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1521034002:":{"text":"What has happened?","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278B02A51CF19C74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521033001:0":{"text":"Weak, useless... Was I the reason the god punished us with these disasters?","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1521033001":{"text":"Weak, useless... Was I the reason the god punished us with these disasters?","source_cn":"我是不是很没用……所以神明才用灾难惩罚呼临城？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19D4AD5C2A734253","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521033002:0":{"text":"I've been trying to learn, to fill the space my father left behind, to be a leader my people can trust...","source_cn":"我也想尽快长大，变得像父亲一样可靠，受人尊敬……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF456599BA73263C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521033004:0":{"text":"I thought of so many ways to help the hungry, but every proposal got rejected...","source_cn":"我想了很多方法，想要帮助吃不上饭的人，但一直都被否决……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5236BE003634D9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521033005:0":{"text":"Your ideas weren't great. What happened with that father and son proves it.","source_cn":"你的方法没有那么好。刚刚那对父子的遭遇就证明了这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB49EF1BE86E515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521033006:0":{"text":"Sure, the way things are now, everyone gets something, but they're still starving.","source_cn":"为了让更多人领到食物，所以每个人都少拿一点。但他们还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C551F2ACAFFC4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521033007:0":{"text":"The city had a large reserve once, far more than we have now!","source_cn":"但城里的食物原本很多，是现在的好几倍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81818CE9FB09A2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521033008:0":{"text":"But the council chose to attack the Wildborn. So much food was sent to the front lines that the city's stockpile shrank to almost nothing...","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1521033008":{"text":"But the council chose to attack the Wildborn. So much food was sent to the front lines that the city's stockpile shrank to almost nothing...","source_cn":"因为议事官们决定讨伐雅库伯尔，将粮食送去前线，不然城里的存粮不会这么少……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73439749524EB50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521033009:0":{"text":"Of course not! If I'd had the final say, I'd have focused on saving the city first.","source_cn":"当然不是！呼临城正在受灾，如果我能决定的话，肯定要先救灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E60A8ED58BABA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521033011:0":{"text":"What about Perseus? Didn't you say he was on your side?","source_cn":"珀尔修斯呢？你说过，他支持你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC733F568C49279E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521033012:0":{"text":"He did. He opposed the idea of a frontal assault. But Mr. Bakis and the council pushed it through.","source_cn":"……他确实不同意正面出兵。但是比博老师和其他议事官坚持。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02BE501CA153863","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521033013:0":{"text":"They argued that we couldn't fight famine, that only the God of Harvest could end the drought. Since the gods have ignored Halia for so long, the only hope was to seize Wildborn land.","source_cn":"大家都说，饥荒没办法很快解决，干旱也只能向丰饶神祈求，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CD19A1A0F788D33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521033014:0":{"text":"Otherwise, everyone here would starve... and I couldn't allow that.","source_cn":"否则，否则呼临人都会饿死……我不能看着呼临城发生这种事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC82AD2A4950EB2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521033015:1":{"text":"But then they said we must seize Wildborn land quickly, so they sent even more food to the front. The city's reserves just kept shrinking...","source_cn":"可是……可是之后他们又说必须尽快攻占雅库伯尔，所以把很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF2D34F4776079CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521033016:0":{"text":"I... I didn't know what to do anymore. There's no turning back...","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1521033016":{"text":"I... I didn't know what to do anymore. There's no turning back...","source_cn":"我、我也不知道该怎么办……我没有回头路可以走……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C3A84E66F7CFED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1521033017:0":{"text":"I... I see what you mean...","source_cn":"我、我知道你的意思了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x024A06E58322099C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I... I see what you mean...","female":"I... I see what you mean...","variant_male_record_index":"181853","variant_female_record_index":"181854","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521033019:0":{"text":"I'm sorry.","source_cn":"对不起……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CC81DDE3A06174","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521033020:0":{"text":"Don't apologize. The ones who should apologize are your council.","source_cn":"和你比起来，那些议事官更应该道歉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26C239CD0688F645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1521033021:0":{"text":"Hmm?","source_cn":"咦……？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F74F80CE685FAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1521033022:0":{"text":"You're the Regulus. No matter your age, your word should be respected and obeyed.","source_cn":"你是领主，无论年纪多小，他们都应该听从你的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40370A4139936EDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521033023:0":{"text":"If you say \"no war,\" no one should raise a sword.","source_cn":"你不想开战，他们就应该听从你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D317EA94E910A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521033024:0":{"text":"Any disobedience should mean punishment: imprisonment, hard labor... even life.","source_cn":"如果反抗，就该惩罚。关起来，或者做苦力，或者让他们献出生命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BD5EE860DE232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521033025:1":{"text":"Life?! You mean I should have them killed?","source_cn":"献……献出生命？！你的意思是……杀了他们吗？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF84C815DFD6A471B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Life?! You mean I should have them killed?","female":"Life?! You mean I should have them killed?","variant_male_record_index":"181862","variant_female_record_index":"181863","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521033026:0":{"text":"That's too harsh! They only disagreed with me. They haven't committed any crime!","source_cn":"这太严重了……他们只是和我意见不同，又没有真的犯罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC605864F01822D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1521033026":{"text":"That's too harsh! They only disagreed with me. They haven't committed any crime!","source_cn":"这太严重了……他们只是和我意见不同，又没有真的犯罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC605864F01822D42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521033027:0":{"text":"Maybe... maybe they were just trying their best, like I was.","source_cn":"可能他们也没有更好的办法……和我一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8E1F0AD41B10AFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1521033029:0":{"text":"Mr. Bakis always said a kind ruler should... uh... forgive those who...","source_cn":"比博老师说过，一个仁爱的君主，应该……呃，应该宽恕那些……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0CFF35561B7B41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521033030:0":{"text":"Ugh, I can't remember the exact words.\nAnyway, the point is, it's unfair to blame someone for what they don't understand.","source_cn":"唔，我不记得原话了……\\n总之，意思是不要因为他人的无...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB054E306E2E21F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521033031:0":{"text":"That's not how the Wildborn see it.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔不是这样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x862AE6230500B936","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1521033032:0":{"text":"Disrespect the Hunting Goddess, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","source_cn":"不敬狩猎神，不听从神谕或首领命令的人，都——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB114BAD0CF224CA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Disrespect the Hunting Goddess, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","female":"Disrespect the Hunting God, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","variant_male_record_index":"181870","variant_female_record_index":"181871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:38:1521033032":{"text":"Disrespect the Hunting Goddess, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","source_cn":"不敬狩猎神，不听从神谕或首领命令的人，都——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB114BAD0CF224CA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Disrespect the Hunting Goddess, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","female":"Disrespect the Hunting God, or disobey the tribe leader, and you'll—","variant_male_record_index":"181870","variant_female_record_index":"181871","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521033033:0":{"text":"Huh? Why stop her? She hasn't even told me what the Wildborn...","source_cn":"咦？为什么不让她继续说？我还想听兽人的——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E0AF1F46F0614C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Huh? Why stop her? She hasn't even told me what the Wildborn...","female":"Huh? Why stop her? She hasn't even told me what the Wildborn...","variant_male_record_index":"181872","variant_female_record_index":"181873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1521033034:0":{"text":"Make way! Make way! Message for the Regulus!","source_cn":"——让一下！让一下！我有紧急军情要回城里汇报！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73F94E719932EF1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:44:1521032001:":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog45>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCAB2BD21B2EA823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:44:1521032002:":{"text":"Did I really do that badly?","source_cn":"我真的做得很糟糕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F3F0506C7CD625D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:44:1521032003:":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog104>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7BE6E6A945A0962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:44:1521032004:":{"text":"Is all this... Halia's suffering, because of me?","source_cn":"呼临城的灾难是因为我吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91EA26CE34D3012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:44:1521034001:":{"text":"Please! make way!","source_cn":"呼、呼！麻烦让一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD458CEF998BB9A87","variant_status":"","male":"","fem